<#
    Deltempo one-line installer - headless CLI target
    ==========================================================================
    CLI   irm https://beso1227.github.io/Deltempo/win-cli | iex
    GUI   irm https://beso1227.github.io/Deltempo/win     | iex

    Invoke-Expression accepts no arguments, so the target is passed to the
    shared installer through DELTEMPO_TARGET. The installer consumes that
    variable, so a later run defaults back to the GUI.
#>

$env:DELTEMPO_TARGET = 'cli'
iex (irm https://beso1227.github.io/Deltempo/win)
